    helo:2000004 "HEO-L-53c7962089f2" ;
    helo:9000016 "machine-reviewed" ;
    helo:9000017 "The budget constraint is not an arithmetic input; supply-side thresholds rest on the opportunity cost it creates"@en ;
    helo:9000018 "Judging Value for Money, Budget Constraint is an optional concept of step 6 and Cost-Effectiveness Threshold is a core concept of step 3"@en ;
    helo:9000019 "Review B finds HEO right, a supply-side threshold is health forgone under a fixed budget. Proposed pathway change, teach budget constraint before step 3 of Judging Value for Money or list it as a builds-on concept."@en .

