    helo:2000001 1 ;
    helo:9000004 "How to count what a treatment uses and give each resource a money value, whether that is one item or a whole budget."@en ;
    helo:9000005 "Every economic evaluation rests on its cost inputs, so the pathway starts with how resource use is measured and valued."@en .

helo:6000003 a owl:NamedIndividual,
