    helo:1000007 hewc:amr-economic-burden ;
    helo:1000012 helo:5000027 ;
    helo:2000001 3 ;
    helo:9000004 "How much a disease costs a population each year, and what that figure can and cannot tell a decision maker."@en ;
    helo:9000005 "Cost-of-illness studies take the same costing methods further, adding up what a disease costs a whole population each year rather than one episode of care."@en .

