    rdfs:label "QALYs, DALYs and summary measures in Measuring Health Gain"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/helo> ;
    helo:1000002 helo:5000002 ;
    helo:1000003 helo:6000007 ;
    helo:1000004 helo:6000005 ;
    helo:1000005 helo:5100006 ;
    helo:1000006 hewc:daly,
        hewc:daly-calculation-method,
        hewc:disability-weight,
        hewc:health-related-quality-of-life,
        hewc:qaly,
        hewc:qaly-calculation-method,
        hewc:qaly-gain,
        hewc:years-lived-with-disability ;
    helo:1000007 hewc:active-life-expectancy,
        hewc:health-adjusted-life-year,
        hewc:healthy-year-equivalent,
        hewc:quality-adjusted-time-without-symptoms,
        hewc:time-without-symptoms-of-progression ;
    helo:1000012 helo:5000030 ;
    helo:2000001 3 ;
    helo:9000004 "Combining length of life with its quality in one number, counted as QALYs gained or DALYs averted."@en ;
    helo:9000005 "With a utility for each health state, time spent in each state can now be weighted and added up into one measure of health."@en .

helo:6000009 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        helo:0000002 ;
    rdfs:label "Discounting in Judging Value for Money"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/helo> ;
    helo:1000002 helo:5000003 ;
    helo:1000003 helo:6000010 ;
    helo:1000004 helo:6000008 ;
    helo:1000005 helo:5100009 ;
    helo:1000006 hewc:discount-rate,
        hewc:discounting-costs,
        hewc:discounting-health,
        hewc:present-value,
        hewc:time-preference ;
    helo:1000007 hewc:age-weighting,
        hewc:differential-discounting,
        hewc:future-value,
        hewc:hyperbolic-discounting ;
    helo:1000012 helo:5000033 ;
    helo:2000001 2 ;
    helo:9000004 "Why costs and health effects that arrive later count for less today, and by how much."@en ;
    helo:9000005 "Most evaluations run over several years, so future costs and health need converting to present values before options are compared."@en .

helo:6000012 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        helo:0000002 ;
    rdfs:label "Cost-benefit analysis and investment appraisal in Judging Value for Money"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/helo> ;
    helo:1000002 helo:5000003 ;
    helo:1000003 helo:6000013 ;
    helo:1000004 helo:6000011 ;
    helo:1000005 helo:5100012 ;
    helo:1000006 hewc:benefit-cost-ratio,
        hewc:cost-benefit-analysis,
        hewc:incremental-net-benefit,
        hewc:net-present-value ;
    helo:1000007 hewc:break-even-analysis,
        hewc:break-even-point,
        hewc:internal-rate-of-return,
        hewc:payback-period,
        hewc:return-on-investment,
        hewc:shadow-price,
        hewc:social-return-on-investment ;
    helo:1000012 helo:5000036 ;
    helo:2000001 5 ;
    helo:9000004 "Valuing health gains in money, so an option can be judged on whether its benefits exceed its costs."@en ;
    helo:9000005 "Some decisions reach beyond health care, and valuing every outcome in money puts them on one scale."@en .

helo:6000013 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        helo:0000002 ;
    rdfs:label "Budget impact analysis in Judging Value for Money"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/helo> ;
    helo:1000002 helo:5000003 ;
    helo:1000003 helo:6000014 ;
    helo:1000004 helo:6000012 ;
    helo:1000005 helo:5100013 ;
    helo:1000006 hewc:affordability,
        hewc:budget-impact-analysis,
        hewc:budget-impact-model,
        hewc:net-budget-impact ;
    helo:1000007 hewc:adoption-curve,
        hewc:affordability-threshold,
        hewc:budget-approval,
        hewc:budget-constraint,
        hewc:budget-impact,
        hewc:budget-impact-modelling ;
    helo:1000012 helo:5000037 ;
    helo:2000001 6 ;
    helo:9000004 "Whether a payer can afford an option in the years after the option is adopted, which is a separate question from value for money."@en ;
    helo:9000005 "A cost-effective option can still be too costly to fund in a given year, so affordability is checked as a separate question."@en .

helo:6000015 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        helo:0000002 ;
    rdfs:label "HTA processes and methods in Deciding What to Fund"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/helo> ;
    helo:1000002 helo:5000004 ;
    helo:1000003 helo:6000016 ;
    helo:1000005 helo:5100015 ;
