    helo:1000012 helo:5000042 ;
    helo:2000001 3 ;
    helo:9000004 "Models where patients move between health states in fixed cycles, with costs and health added up for each state over time."@en ;
    helo:9000005 "Decision trees grow unwieldy when events repeat over many years, and state-transition models handle repeating events in a compact way."@en .

