        hewc:system-dynamics-model,
        hewc:transmission-model ;
    helo:1000012 helo:5000047 ;
    helo:2000001 8 ;
    helo:9000004 "Models where the number of people infected changes the risk for everyone else, as with infectious disease and vaccination."@en ;
    helo:9000005 "For infectious disease, treating one person changes the risk for others, which needs a model where the population feeds back on itself."@en .

