    helo:1000007 hewc:alcohol-policy ;
    helo:1000012 helo:5000064 ;
    helo:2000001 3 ;
    helo:9000004 "How governments use measures such as vaccination programmes and limits on alcohol to prevent illness across a whole population."@en ;
    helo:9000005 "Not all health policy concerns single medicines, so the pathway widens to measures that act on a whole population before people fall ill."@en .

