    helo:9000004 "How differences in health and in access to care are measured, which of them count as unfair, and how an evaluation can show who gains and who loses."@en ;
    helo:9000005 "With medicines and prevention policy in place, the last step asks whether their gains are shared fairly, which needs its own measures and methods."@en .

