[] a owl:Axiom ;
    rdfs:comment "The outline row of module 9 names all six ontologies in its interactive piece and real material, so the module's material uses the Real Health Economics Ontology (RHEO). Representational is the nearest of the five linking kinds of HEAO 0.2.0. A module whose material uses an ontology records that use and does not describe the ontology."@en ;
    owl:annotatedProperty helo:9000013 ;
    owl:annotatedSource helo:8000016 ;
    owl:annotatedTarget <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/rheo> ;
    heao:9000001 heao:4000002 .

[] a owl:Axiom ;
    obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000428 ;
    owl:annotatedProperty helo:9000006 ;
    owl:annotatedSource helo:5000002 ;
    owl:annotatedTarget heto:4000009 ;
    heao:9000001 heao:4000002 ;
    helo:9000009 1.00 ;
    helo:9000010 "3 of the 3 HEO concepts that HETO 0.3.0 relates to the task Assign utility values to model health states are core concepts of Measuring Health Gain (Health State Utility Value, Quality-Adjusted Life Year (QALY), Utility), at least half, so the build proposes that the pathway prepares for the task. HETO's own relationships from tasks to HEO concepts are proposals too. The pathway builds understanding of these concepts and does not train the task. Representational is the nearest of the five linking kinds of HEAO 0.2.0. Preparing a learner for a task is none of them exactly."@en ;
    helo:9000021 3 ;
    helo:9000022 3 .

[] a owl:Axiom ;
    obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000428 ;
    owl:annotatedProperty helo:9000006 ;
    owl:annotatedSource helo:5000005 ;
    owl:annotatedTarget heto:4000015 ;
    heao:9000001 heao:4000002 ;
    helo:9000009 0.50 ;
    helo:9000010 "3 of the 6 HEO concepts that HETO 0.3.0 relates to the task Run a probabilistic sensitivity analysis are core concepts of Building the Model (Monte Carlo Simulation, Parameter Distribution, Probabilistic Sensitivity Analysis), at least half, so the build proposes that the pathway prepares for the task. HETO's own relationships from tasks to HEO concepts are proposals too. The pathway builds understanding of these concepts and does not train the task. Representational is the nearest of the five linking kinds of HEAO 0.2.0. Preparing a learner for a task is none of them exactly."@en ;
    helo:9000021 3 ;
    helo:9000022 6 .

[] a owl:Axiom ;
    obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000428 ;
    owl:annotatedProperty helo:9000006 ;
    owl:annotatedSource helo:5000005 ;
    owl:annotatedTarget heto:4000014 ;
    heao:9000001 heao:4000002 ;
    helo:9000009 1.00 ;
    helo:9000010 "3 of the 3 HEO concepts that HETO 0.3.0 relates to the task Run a deterministic sensitivity analysis are core concepts of Building the Model (Deterministic Sensitivity Analysis, One-Way Sensitivity Analysis, Tornado Diagram), at least half, so the build proposes that the pathway prepares for the task. HETO's own relationships from tasks to HEO concepts are proposals too. The pathway builds understanding of these concepts and does not train the task. Representational is the nearest of the five linking kinds of HEAO 0.2.0. Preparing a learner for a task is none of them exactly."@en ;
    helo:9000021 3 ;
    helo:9000022 3 .

[] a owl:Axiom ;
    obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000428 ;
    owl:annotatedProperty helo:9000006 ;
    owl:annotatedSource helo:5000003 ;
    owl:annotatedTarget heto:4000012 ;
    heao:9000001 heao:4000002 ;
    helo:9000009 0.57 ;
    helo:9000010 "4 of the 7 HEO concepts that HETO 0.3.0 relates to the task Calculate incremental cost-effectiveness results are core concepts of Judging Value for Money (Cost-Effectiveness Threshold, Dominance, Extended Dominance, Incremental Cost-Effectiveness Ratio (ICER)), at least half, so the build proposes that the pathway prepares for the task. HETO's own relationships from tasks to HEO concepts are proposals too. The pathway builds understanding of these concepts and does not train the task. Representational is the nearest of the five linking kinds of HEAO 0.2.0. Preparing a learner for a task is none of them exactly."@en ;
    helo:9000021 4 ;
    helo:9000022 7 .

[] a owl:Axiom ;
    obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000428 ;
    owl:annotatedProperty helo:9000006 ;
    owl:annotatedSource helo:5000003 ;
    owl:annotatedTarget heto:4000016 ;
    heao:9000001 heao:4000002 ;
    helo:9000009 0.50 ;
    helo:9000010 "1 of the 2 HEO concepts that HETO 0.3.0 relates to the task Report an economic evaluation are core concepts of Judging Value for Money (Economic Evaluation), at least half, so the build proposes that the pathway prepares for the task. This proposal rests on a single concept, so it is weaker. HETO's own relationships from tasks to HEO concepts are proposals too. The pathway builds understanding of these concepts and does not train the task. Representational is the nearest of the five linking kinds of HEAO 0.2.0. Preparing a learner for a task is none of them exactly."@en ;
    helo:9000021 1 ;
    helo:9000022 2 .

[] a owl:Axiom ;
    obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000428 ;
    owl:annotatedProperty helo:9000006 ;
    owl:annotatedSource helo:5000005 ;
    owl:annotatedTarget heto:4000019 ;
    heao:9000001 heao:4000002 ;
    helo:9000009 1.00 ;
    helo:9000010 "2 of the 2 HEO concepts that HETO 0.3.0 relates to the task Run scenario analyses are core concepts of Building the Model (Scenario Analysis, Structural Uncertainty), at least half, so the build proposes that the pathway prepares for the task. HETO's own relationships from tasks to HEO concepts are proposals too. The pathway builds understanding of these concepts and does not train the task. Representational is the nearest of the five linking kinds of HEAO 0.2.0. Preparing a learner for a task is none of them exactly."@en ;
    helo:9000021 2 ;
    helo:9000022 2 .

[] a owl:Axiom ;
    obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000428 ;
    owl:annotatedProperty helo:9000006 ;
    owl:annotatedSource helo:5000001 ;
    owl:annotatedTarget heto:4000008 ;
    heao:9000001 heao:4000002 ;
    helo:9000009 0.50 ;
    helo:9000010 "2 of the 4 HEO concepts that HETO 0.3.0 relates to the task Select unit costs are core concepts of Counting the Cost (Cost Valuation, Micro-Costing), at least half, so the build proposes that the pathway prepares for the task. HETO's own relationships from tasks to HEO concepts are proposals too. The pathway builds understanding of these concepts and does not train the task. Representational is the nearest of the five linking kinds of HEAO 0.2.0. Preparing a learner for a task is none of them exactly."@en ;
    helo:9000021 2 ;
    helo:9000022 4 .

