    heao:9000001 heao:4000002 ;
    helo:9000009 0.67 ;
    helo:9000010 "2 of the 3 HEO concepts that HETO 0.3.0 relates to the task Conduct a model-based economic evaluation are core concepts of Judging Value for Money (Cost-Effectiveness Analysis, Economic Evaluation), at least half, so the build proposes that the pathway prepares for the task. HETO's own relationships from tasks to HEO concepts are proposals too. The pathway builds understanding of these concepts and does not train the task. Representational is the nearest of the five linking kinds of HEAO 0.2.0. Preparing a learner for a task is none of them exactly."@en ;
    helo:9000021 2 ;
    helo:9000022 3 .

[] a owl:Axiom ;
    obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000428 ;
    owl:annotatedProperty helo:9000006 ;
    owl:annotatedSource helo:5000001 ;
    owl:annotatedTarget heto:4000020 ;
    heao:9000001 heao:4000002 ;
    helo:9000009 0.50 ;
    helo:9000010 "1 of the 2 HEO concepts that HETO 0.3.0 relates to the task Value resource use are core concepts of Counting the Cost (Cost Valuation), at least half, so the build proposes that the pathway prepares for the task. This proposal rests on a single concept, so it is weaker. HETO's own relationships from tasks to HEO concepts are proposals too. The pathway builds understanding of these concepts and does not train the task. Representational is the nearest of the five linking kinds of HEAO 0.2.0. Preparing a learner for a task is none of them exactly."@en ;
    helo:9000021 1 ;
    helo:9000022 2 .

