    helo:9000010 "2 of the 3 HEO concepts that HETO 0.3.0 relates to the task Add discounting to an economic model are core concepts of Judging Value for Money (Discount Rate, Present Value), at least half, so the build proposes that the pathway prepares for the task. HETO's own relationships from tasks to HEO concepts are proposals too. The pathway builds understanding of these concepts and does not train the task. Representational is the nearest of the five linking kinds of HEAO 0.2.0. Preparing a learner for a task is none of them exactly."@en ;
    helo:9000021 2 ;
    helo:9000022 3 .

