[] a owl:Axiom ;
    obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000428 ;
    owl:annotatedProperty helo:9000006 ;
    owl:annotatedSource helo:5000003 ;
    owl:annotatedTarget heto:4000004 ;
    heao:9000001 heao:4000002 ;
    helo:9000009 1.00 ;
    helo:9000010 "The one HEO concept that HETO 0.3.0 relates to the task Set the time horizon (Time Horizon) is a core concept of Judging Value for Money, so the build proposes that the pathway prepares for the task. This proposal rests on a single concept, so it is weaker. HETO's own relationships from tasks to HEO concepts are proposals too. The pathway builds understanding of these concepts and does not train the task. Representational is the nearest of the five linking kinds of HEAO 0.2.0. Preparing a learner for a task is none of them exactly."@en ;
    helo:9000021 1 ;
    helo:9000022 1 .

